From 54c1bc220ed520610922df04093e4100b3bf2908 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: axon7-build <axon7-build@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:17:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/24] msm: camera: ZTE's 3.18 camera ABI for the axon7 camera
 blobs

The rear camera reported an empty stream configuration (0x0 sizes): the
camera daemon and HAL (Android 8 blobs) talk ZTE's 3.18 camera ABI, which
differs from 4.4's in enums and structs (CFG_POWER_RESET in the sensor
commands, actuator CCI info and register read/write with their struct
members, OIS deinit/read, bakeup_slave_addr, SENSOR_PMIC, no laser LED
sub-module, no CUSTOM3 gpio, no VMIPI, no csiphy data_rate).

- msm_cam_sensor.h (uapi and kernel) and msm_camsensor_sdk.h are ZTE's;
  4.4-only additions that do not move anything (flash query, META12) are
  appended
- ported from ZTE: CFG_POWER_RESET (power down + up), actuator CCI info
  and register read/write (also the compat path), OIS deinit and read
- 4.4-only uses dropped: laser LED driver, CAM_VMIPI, SENSOR_GPIO_CUSTOM3,
  CFG_OIS_CALIBRATION (Xiaomi), csiphy data_rate (0)

